# Breaking the Bonds of Fate (battlefield.breaking_the_bonds_of_fate#helper, Talacca Cove): a party at _1l0: main (a
# level 75 Corsair at level cap 75, Breaking the Bonds of Fate accepted at Quest[6][41]Prog 1 (GMs), one Corsair's
# Testimony) enters area 1 (49) by the testimony: TESTIMONY_WEARS (3 shown, 2 left). The members by the trigger, no
# trade: bob (completed) and cat (accepted, Quest[6][41]Prog 2) each get the 32000 menu (0,0,0,8); each update 49:
# REQS_NOT_MET (5); finished: not entered (one player to a battlefield). dan (accepted, Quest[6][41]Prog 0) gets only
# the door's default (DefaultActions.lua messageSpecial -1, shown as 32767), no menu; his update and finish-if-event
# find no event.
